{"id":219632018418247,"type":"artist","name":"Caravan","artist":null,"year":1968,"weight":26,"info":{"country":"GB","begin":"1968-01","kind":"Group","similar":["Hatfield and the North","Camel","Soft Machine","Gentle Giant","Van der Graaf Generator","Gong","National Health","Renaissance","Emerson, Lake & Palmer","Matching Mole"],"disambiguation":"Canterbury group","img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/PyeHastings.jpg?width=500","bio":"Caravan es una banda inglesa del área de Canterbury, fundada por algunos de los miembros del grupo Wilde Flowers: Dave Sinclair, Richard Sinclair, Pye Hastings y Richard Coughlan. Caravan alcanzó el éxito durante los años que van de 1968 a los primeros 70 como parte de la escena de Canterbury, combinando el rock psicodélico y el jazz en un sonido propio, cercano al de sus coetáneos Soft Machine. Caravan sigue en activo a comienzos del siglo XXI.","tags":["Progressive rock","Canterbury Scene","Canterbury","rock","Progressive"]},"works":[{"id":181866284665489,"type":"album","name":"Caravan","artist":"Caravan","year":1969,"weight":3,"yt":"ik8dE1-SQtg","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":116078530059197,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Canterbury Scene","rank":33,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":89140593729256,"type":"album","name":"If I Could Do It All Over Again","artist":"Caravan","year":1970,"weight":12,"yt":"wtpsUENW5Pw","src":"books,charts,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":65232636722211,"name":"Scaruffi 1970s","rank":211,"scaruffi":7.0}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":233021246031352,"type":"album","name":"If I Could Do It All Over Again, I'd Do It All Over You","artist":"Caravan","year":1970,"weight":7,"yt":"ci3amN12HcE","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":11393629798029,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Progressive Rock","rank":65,"scaruffi":null},{"id":116078530059197,"name