ruffi","start":1968,"end":1984,"desc":"Uno de los movimientos más importantes de la historia del rock nace en 1962 con los Wilde Flowers, de los que salen Soft Machine y Caravan. Soft Machine pasan del dadaísmo psicodélico al jazz-rock (3, con la «Moon In June» de Wyatt); Caravan hacen un jazz-rock más ligero y melódico; Nucleus, Keith Tippett, Egg; Gong de Daevid Allen, psicodelia cósmica y demente (Flying Teapot); Kevin Ayers, dandi decadente; Robert Wyatt y Rock Bottom, «una de las obras maestras supremas del rock»; Hatfield & The North, National Health; Mike Oldfield, que con Tubular Bells vuelve obsoleto el término «progresivo»; y la segunda generación de Henry Cow (Rock In Opposition), Slapp Happy y Art Bears.","color":"#38bdf8","family":"Progresivo, krautrock y jazz-rock","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#canterbury"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":89140593729256,"artist":"Caravan","artist_id":219632018418247,"title":"If I Could Do It All Over Again","year":1969,"ess":1,"yt":"ci3amN12HcE","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Escuela de Canterbury","scene_id":119686161909791,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#canterbury","chapters":["Sección 3.6"],"pages":[[1,62,null]]},{"id":25322822968606,"artist":"Caravan","artist_id":219632018418247,"title":"In The Land Of Grey And Pink","year":1971,"ess":1,"yt":"sTAhkb31khY","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Escuela de Canterbury","scene_id":119686161909791,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#canterbury","chapters":["Sección 3.6"],"pages":[[1,62,null]]},{"id":941275788463,"artist":"Caravan","artist_id":219632018418247,"title":"Waterloo Lily","year":1972,"ess":1,"yt":"KqupduU4mBo","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":